<title>FRANCE: French production bottlenecks stay low - survey.</title>
<headline>French production bottlenecks stay low - survey.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>French production bottlenecks remain remain low, national statistics institute INSEE said in its quarterly survey of business leaders, conducted in January.</p>
<p>It gave the following data on percentages of companies reporting production bottlenecks:</p>
<p>			    1997 1996 96   96  96   95  95  95</p>
<p>			    Jan  Oct  Jul  Apr Jan  Oct Jul Apr</p>
<p> Industry overall	15   16   14  15  13   19  29  25</p>
<p> Manufacturing	   10   12   12  11  13   17  30  30</p>
<p> Agri-business	   14   11    9   9   9    9   8   5</p>
<p> Semi-finished goods   13   16   15  14  17   22  39  35</p>
<p> Capital goods	   12   11   14   9  10   14  15  13</p>
<p> Cars, land transport   2    3    4   8  10   10  49  49</p>
<p> Consumer goods	  10   13   12  10  12   20  22  27</p>
<p> Energy		    85   85   59  89  30   63  66   2</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5381</p>
